  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/09/Chicuelina1.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px;\">(34 fotos) La pe&ntilde;a cultural taurina Chicuelina de Onda ha entregado este fin de semana su medalla de oro anual a Jos&eacute; Antonio Gracia Tejedor, expresidente de la plaza de toros de Castell&oacute;. </span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/09/Chicuelina2.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12.8px;\">Previamente se ha presentado &#39;el bou de Fira&#39; de la ganader&iacute;a de Montalvo, que se exhibir&aacute; y embolar&aacute; el primer d&iacute;a de las fiestas, s&aacute;bado 21 de octubre, a cargo de Jos&eacute; Ignacio P&eacute;rez-Tabernero S&aacute;nchez.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/chicuelina/img_8410.jpg\" alt=\"img_8410\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/chicuelina/img_8413.jpg\" alt=\"img_8413\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/chicuelina/img_8416.jpg\" alt=\"img_8416\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/chicuelina/img_8418.jpg\" alt=\"img_8418\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/chicuelina/img_8420.jpg\" alt=\"img_8420\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/chicuelina/img_8423.jpg\" alt=\"img_8423\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/chicuelina/img_8428.j